title: MikroTik REST API: MLAG Bond
agents: mikrotik_rest_api
catalog: hw/network/mikrotik
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Member ports and LACP partner of a dual-connected MikroTik bond, a
 bonding interface with an {mlag-id} ({/interface/bonding/monitor}).

 No active member port (or bond not running) is CRIT, inactive member
 ports are WARN, no LACP partner (mode 802.3ad) is WARN by default.
 States via the rule {MikroTik REST API: MLAG bonds}.

 Special agent {MikroTik RouterOS (mikrotik-rest-api)} in Setup > Agents >
 Other integrations, module "MLAG". Not yet verified on MLAG hardware.

 Added in mikrotik-rest-api 1.3.0 by Klaus Paulitsch.

item:
 The name of the bond.

perfdata:
 Number of active member ports.

inventory:
 One service per enabled bond with an mlag-id, only on devices with an
 MLAG bridge.
